title: ra_NPCDialogue
---
<<declare $hasLuisGlasses = false>>
<<checkGlasses ra>>
<<if $hasLuisGlasses>>
    <<jump ra_ReturnGlasses>>
<<endif>>
<<setPhase ra>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "quest_started">>
    <<jump ra_GlassesQuest>>
<<endif>>
RA: Why have you summoned me?
-> Why am I here
    RA: You came to me. Now I will take care of you.
    <<jump ra_GlassesQuest>>
-> How do I leave here?
    RA: Leave? I canʼt let you leave yet, play a game with me.
    Player: What game.
    RA: I will give you a mystery and you get to ask 5 questions. You may leave if you solve it.
    Player: And if I donʼt?
    RA: Then you will be forever trapped in here with me.
    <<jump ra_Mystery>>
===

title: ra_Mystery
---
RA: She gifted me a pair of glasses.她送了我一副眼镜。
RA: I was able to see the blackboard clearly now, but never was able to properly attend class.我看清了黑板，却再也没能好好上课。
RA: Four months, they took care of it in just one week.四个月的事，他们只用一周就解决了。
RA: Then, I'll also use four months.后来，我也用了四个月。
RA: If he can't see then he won't be able to properly attend class either.他看不见了也就没办法好好上课了
RA: But I'm still not satisfied.可我还是不满意。
RA: There's so many blind peeople, so why is it just him who can't see anymore?明明有那么多瞎子，可为什么只有他看不见了？
<<jump ra_GlassesQuest>>
===

title: ra_GlassesQuest
---
RA: I will give you a chance to leave.
RA: But it would require you to get something for me. Go to Tom's room, there is a locked closet. In the closet, there is my glasses. I donʼt know where the key is but you can consider looking where he died.
<<startGlassesQuest ra>>
<<getPhase ra "quest_started">>
<<stop>>
===

title: ra_ReturnGlasses
---
RA: Thank you for returning my glasses back to me.
RA: As promised, I'll let you leave. Just leave through the exit, I have opened the door for you.
<<returnGlasses ra>>
<<stop>>
===
